    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "CRAIG FERGUSON",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108989943931351713237/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXscDXoA7pI8TcGcos3qAlzoOWRW0fGFK9f8zJuaRj43y7GYxGq0A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Claude (mechanic ) is honest and trustworthy, he’s well known in St Lazare area , always helpful and knowledgeable, been using his service for years before and since he moved to this garage. The gentleman at the front desk I always talk to is also very helpful and courteous",
        "time": 1655722860,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alexandria Harriet",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103024507985893255561/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKUNBvnnHPIv1688UoAWR_tdutHS2bjULmjl3H-BiN2J66h5w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "My vehicle was having issues that another mechanic couldn't fix as it required more specialization. My vehicle was transferred there and upon inspection needed a new electric computer module (ECM). This mechanic helped look for a second-hand ECM (as costs were a big issue for me). This company was professional, informative, cost- efficient and understanding to my situation. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1682796462,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Maxim N",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100517812360016523662/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXKbUsDeEPxXxQqhHJolcAW3LaF6l7ua4NhHEAcMj97reGzmHDL4Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I had a problem with my air conditioner.  Normally I go to MTL with any car troubles , but this time I decided to look for a garage closer to me. So this is how I found Mecano Plus Vaudreuil , and I had a really bad experience with them.\nFirst at all I lost about 40 min at reception desk waiting  while the guy was on the phone and after that he couldn’t find my appointment that I booked in advance . I explained my problem, and he said that that they are going to do a vacuum test to check the system before filling it with freon.\nIn 40 minutes my car was ready. The person who repaired it told me that he made the  test, everything is good  and he refilled the system.  I was paid $273 (including $15 as covid fee).  Two  days later  air conditioner stopped cooling at all.  I was really upset and in few days I returned to Mecano Plus to find the leek in the system. Person on reception told me, that it is impossible to find the leek, because they didn’t  put a colorant in the system.  (what they were supposed to do when I initially came and I was sure it was already done)  I have a hybrid car, and he said that the colorant for hybrid car air conditional system should be different and they have to contact dealer Toyota to find all information about conditioner oil and colorant type for that oil. He said that he will give an appointment in few days.\nI replayed that I would not pay for nothing and I want to know how much I need to pay to fix the problem.  He told me that he will contact the dealer Toyota and he will call me back as soon as possible. It was more than 5 weeks ago and I have never got any feedback from them.\nFinally the problem was found and fixed. I went  to MTL, Merson garage,  and got a full service for $147.5 (including $2.5 as covid fee).\nSo, I think there are two scenarios:\n\n1)\tThey  know everything  about oils and colorants, but they wanted me to pay twice to find the leek.\n2)\tThey really know nothing about oils and colorants for hybrid cars.\nAnyway I don’t like none of these two: first, they are crosseurs,  second,  they don’t have enough competences to work with air conditioner on hybrid car. I waste $273 and I will never come back to that company and will advice to all my friends to avoid them.",
        "time": 1626998320,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "David Robbins",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115957228115499503140/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWFTbmIkyE916XUvNc4QKcl1sC8X17MRkRcb4zqDZjaMf1NA01MgA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Great service and staff. They do excellent work and the pricing is very reasonable. I always bring my car here for everything I need. They do everything they can to accommodate you and are the best.",
        "time": 1703268282,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Terry Diachun",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108909639266880102904/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLFO_mOZcXVD6pje-ofE0XSkwtCNMo8Ou7Fd8dSMPEnSBkaS0w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Had a engine light come on, Guillaume told me it could be option1 (cheap} or option 2 {ouch}. I am now on Vacation and get the good news that it is fortunately option 1. He could have ordered the part for the more expensive repair but went the honest route and he has earned my trust. Thanks Mecano Plus, you have now earned my loyalty.",
        "time": 1684518804,
        "translated": false
      }
